  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidî wakumukaku, wakaya ku lubuebue lua Adulama; hakunvua bana babo ne bonso ba mu nsubu wa tatuʼandi lumu elu, bakaya kudiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso bakadi ne ntatu ne bakadi ne mabanza ne bakadi ne kutontolola bakadisangisha kudiye; yeye wakadi kapitene kabo: bantu bakadi nʼandi bakadi bu nkama inai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakumukaku, wakaya ku Misepa wa mu Moaba; yeye wakambila mukelenge wa Moaba ne, Witabushe bua tatuʼanyi ne mamuʼanyi balue, bashikame nʼebe tô ne hanamanya tshidi Nzambi musue kungenzela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakalua nʼabo kudi mukelenge wa Moaba: bakashikama nʼandi tô matuku onso akadi Davidi mushale mu musoko wa ngumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gada muprofete wakambila Davidi ne, Kushadi mu musoko wa ngumbu nansha, Umuke biebe, uye mu buloba bua Yuda, Davidi wakumukaku, wakaya mu ditu dia Helete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakunyua ne, Bakasangana Davidi ne bantu bakadiye nʼabo; Shaula wakadi mushikame muinshi mua mutshi mu Gibea wa mu Lama, wakadi ne difuma diandi mu tshianza tshiandi, bantu bandi bonso bakadi bimane kudiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakebesha bantu bandi bakadi bimane kudiye ne, Nuenu Bena Benyamina, unvuai, Muana eu wa Yishai neanuhe madimi ne madimi a tumuma tukese, anyi? Yeye neanusunguile tupitene tua binunu bia bantu ne tupitene tua nkama ya bantu, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu kai buonso buenu nuakungelela tshifufu, nansha umue wenu wakummanyisha ne, Muana webe mulume wakahunga dî ne muana wa Yishai? Bualu kai nansha umue wenu udi unyingalasha mutshima wandi bualu buanyi? Bualu kai nansha umue wenu wakummanyisha ne, Muanʼebe mulume wakatombosha muntu webe kûdi, bua kualamineye bu mudiye wenza lelu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Doege, Muena Edome, wakadi muimane munkatshi mua bantu ba Shaula, wakamuambila ne, Meme nakatangila muana wa Yishai mulue ku Nobo kudi Ahimeleke, muana wa Ahituba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakebesha Yehowa bualu buandi, wakamuha bintu bia kudia ne muele wa nvita wa Goleyata, Muena Peleshete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakatuma dî, wakabikila Ahimeleke muakuidi, muana wa Ahituba, ne bantu bonso bakadi mu nsubu wandi, bakadi bakuidi ba mu Nobo; buonso buabo bakalua kudi mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakamba ne, Unvua, wewe muana wa Ahituba. Yeye wakamukudimuna ne, Ndiku, mukelenge wanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakamuebesha ne, Wewe wakungelela tshifufu ne muana wa Yishai bua kumuha bintu bia kudia ne muele wa nvita, wakuebesha Nzambi bualu buandi, bua yeye antombokele, andadile bu mualaminyi bu mudiye wenza lelu bualu kai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Ahimeleke wakakudimuna mukelenge dî, wakamba ne, Muntu kai wa munkatshi mua bantu bebe udi ne kanemu bu Davidi? Udi muku wa mukelenge, wakadi ne butumbi mu nsubu muebe ne wewe wakamuebeshaku lungenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meme nakabanga kuebesha Nzambi bualu buandi lelu, anyi? Bualu ebu kabuikadi kundi: mukelenge kabishi muntu wandi bua bualu ebu anyi bonso badi mu nsubu wa tatu wandi; bualu bua muntu webe kena mumanye bualu ebu buonso, ne makese ne a bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakamba ne, Ahimeleke, wewe neufue ne bonso ba mu nsubu wa tatu webe bulelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakambila bantu bandi bakadi bimane kudiye ne, Shihai bakuidi ba Yehowa, bualu bua bianza biabo bidi kudi Davidi; bobo bakamanya ne, Davidi wakadi munyeme, kabakungambila. Kadi bantu ba mukelenge bakahidia kulenga bakuidi ba Yehowa bianza biabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakambila Doege ne, Wewe ushihe bakuidi. Doege, Muena Edome, wakatshunguluka, wakashiha bakuidi dituku adi makumi muanda mukulu ne batanu bakadi baluata efoda ya lin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabutula Nobo, musoko wa bakuidi, wakashiha balume ne bakashi ne bana ne tuana tuakadi tuamua mabele ne ngombe ne nyama ya mpunda ne mikoko ne muele wa nvita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umue wa bana ba Ahimeleke, muana wa Ahituba, dina diandi Ebeyatâ, wakahanduka, wakalonda Davidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebeyatâ wakambila Davidi ne, Shaula wakashiha bakuidi ba Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakambila Ebeyatâ ne, Dituku adi diakadiku Doege, Muena Edome, nakamanya ne, Yeye neamanyishe Shaula bulelela. Bantu bonso ba mu nsubu wa tatu webe bakafua bualu buanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ushale nʼanyi, kutshinyi, bualu bua udi ukeba muoyo wanyi ngudi ukeba muoyo webe kabidi; biwashala nʼanyi, neulamibue bimpe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
